    "body": "Just the usual stuffs:\r\n\r\n**OS**: `Ubuntu 20.04 LTS`\r\n**Terminal**: `alacritty 0.4.1`\r\n**Shell**: `zsh 5.8 (x86_64-ubuntu-linux-gnu)`\r\n\r\n**Version**: `starship 0.41.0`\r\n\r\n**Config**:\r\n```toml\r\nadd_newline = false\r\n\r\n[battery.display]\r\nthreshold = 20\r\nstyle = \"bold red\"\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nsymbol = \"❯\" # \"➜\" \"▶\"\r\nvicmd_symbol = \"❮\"\r\n\r\n[cmd_duration]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[conda]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[crystal]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[dotnet]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[elixir]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[elm]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[erlang]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nstyle = \"bold 164\"\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nshow_sync_count = true\r\nprefix = \"(\"\r\nsuffix = \") \"\r\nstyle = \"bold yellow\"\r\n[git_status.conflicted_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\nstyle = \"bold red\"\r\n[git_status.untracked_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\n[git_status.stashed_count]\r\nstashed = \"≡\"\r\nenabled = true\r\n[git_status.modified_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\n[git_status.staged_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\n[git_status.renamed_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\n[git_status.deleted_count]\r\nenabled = true\r\n\r\n[haskell]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[java]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[julia]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[kubernetes]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[nix_shell]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[php]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[singularity]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[terraform]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```",
