    "updated_at": "2020-10-13T18:36:42Z",
    "body": "Hi @Adrian-Grimm I used to get the same issue in zsh.\r\nMy vi mode setting in .zshrc has\r\n```\r\n# Change cursor shape for different vi modes.\r\nfunction zle-keymap-select {\r\n  if [[ ${KEYMAP} == vicmd ]] ||\r\n     [[ $1 = 'block' ]]; then\r\n    echo -ne '\\e[1 q'\r\n  elif [[ ${KEYMAP} == main ]] ||\r\n       [[ ${KEYMAP} == viins ]] ||\r\n       [[ ${KEYMAP} = '' ]] ||\r\n       [[ $1 = 'beam' ]]; then\r\n    echo -ne '\\e[5 q'\r\n  fi\r\n}\r\nzle -N zle-keymap-select\r\n```\r\nIf you put this after `eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"` then the prompt will not work.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
